HB0303 Second Amendment Protection Act-amendments.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Pendergraft, Allemand, McCann and
Styvar and Senator(s) Hicks
AN ACT relating to the protection of constitutional rights; providing an
exception to the Wyoming Governmental Claims Act; providing a civil cause of
action; amending definitions; including peace officers within the Second
Amendment Protection Act; and providing for an effective date.
1/27/2025 Bill Number Assigned
1/28/2025 H Received for Introduction
2/3/2025 H Did not Consider for Introduction